    <h1>Best Lens for Interviews and Talking-Head Videos — A Practical Buying Guide</h1>
    <p class="dek">For interviews and talking-head videos, the best lens is a fast prime or zoom in the 50mm-85mm full-frame equivalent range, ideally f/1.8 or wider, so the face stays flattering and the background falls softly out of focus. Here is exactly which lenses to buy at every budget.</p>
    <div class="meta-row">
      <span>By Ajay K Meena</span>
      <span>Updated: 2026</span>
      <span>10 min read</span>
    </div>
  </div>
